--> 02:23:12.840 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n2022年他此时没进站\n最终丢掉胜利\n\n2412\n02:23:13.120 --> 02:23:14.316 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n其他人会怎么选？\n\n2413\n02:23:14.400 --> 02:23:17.116 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n勒克莱尔拥有近乎免费的进站\n法拉利无需犹豫\n\n2414\n02:23:17.200 --> 02:23:19.720 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若汉密尔顿进站，会落在拉塞尔后面\n\n2415\n02:23:20.960 --> 02:23:23.980 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若比赛不重启，他会丢掉这个位置\n\n2416\n02:23:24.240 --> 02:23:27.696 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若重启，得看拉塞尔是否进站\n以及新胎价值多大\n\n2417\n02:23:27.780 --> 02:23:28.920 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n汉密尔顿必须在1圈内超越拉塞尔\n\n2418\n02:23:29.260 --> 02:23:35.836 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他有进站窗口，但仍很紧张\n法拉利本想留场，汉密尔顿却进站\n\n2420\n02:23:35.920 --> 02:23:37.320 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n那么梅赛德斯怎么选？\n\n2421\n02:23:38.320 --> 02:23:41.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不如留在场上放手一搏\n你刚才提到拉塞尔\n\n2422\n02:23:42.720 --> 02:23:49.940 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若只剩几圈，他会成活靶子\n救援车已到位，正迅速移走赛车\n\n2424\n02:23:51.940 --> 02:23:57.456 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n汉密尔顿2.6秒完成进站\n52圈中的第49圈，拉塞尔留在场上\n\n2425\n02:23:57.540 --> 02:23:58.700 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他已经在大直道上了\n\n2426\n02:23:58.920 --> 02:24:01.916 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n诺里斯进站，拉塞尔留在场上\n看控制线\n","145":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n2426\n02:23:58.920 --> 02:24:01.916 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n诺里斯进站，拉塞尔留在场上\n看控制线\n\n2427\n02:24:02.000 --> 02:24:03.000 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n看那条线\n\n2428\n02:24:03.460 --> 02:24:06.140 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就是它，维修区出口横穿赛道的白线\n\n2429\n02:24:06.360 --> 02:24:10.496 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n拉塞尔以0.2秒优势守住第2\n\n2430\n02:24:10.580 --> 02:24:13.820 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n胜负就在这里决定\n别忘了他也是最后一批进站\n\n2431\n02:24:14.020 --> 02:24:15.296 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n所以他的轮胎更新\n\n2432\n02:24:15.380 --> 02:24:19.020 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但仍远不如汉密尔顿那套闪亮的软胎\n\n2433\n02:24:19.400 --> 02:24:22.660 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n不过他此前慢漏气\n已经完成较晚的进站\n\n2434\n02:24:22.800 --> 02:24:25.460 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n维斯塔潘车载镜头，驶向斯托弯\n\n2435\n02:24:29.860 --> 02:24:33.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n偏离一点点就退出比赛\n我从没见过这种场面\n\n2436\n02:24:33.180 --> 02:24:35.620 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n舒马赫驾驶法拉利也曾在这里撞车\n\n2437\n02:24:35.620 --> 02:24:37.880 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但那次是车头故障，赛车直冲出去\n\n9909034\n02:24:37.880 --> 02:24:39.836 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我怀疑这辆车也有东西坏了\n\n2438\n02:24:39.920 --> 02:24:43.456 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n赛车尾部有东西损坏，失控发生得很早\n\n2439\n02:24:43.540 --> 02:24:47.020 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n维斯塔潘想把赛车拉回赛道\n保持车头向前\n\n2440\n02:24:47.140 --> 02:24:50.600 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n但没能做到，又一次失控\n\n2441\n02:24:51.300 --> 02:24:55.400 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n正如你所说，像是尾翼或某个部件\n没有重新固定\n","146":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n2442\n02:25:18.760 --> 02:25:22.540 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n难以置信，而且冲击载荷如此之大\n\n2443\n02:25:22.960 --> 02:25:24.560 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n安全车出动\n\n2444\n02:25:24.700 --> 02:25:28.016 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n银石赛会工作人员已出色完成清理\n\n2445\n02:25:28.100 --> 02:25:40.140 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n车队和赛事总监总希望重启比赛\n但能让所有赛车在安全车后列队吗？\n\n2448\n02:25:40.440 --> 02:25:43.660 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这情况有点乱成一团，对吧\n\n2449\n02:25:46.000 --> 02:25:51.580 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n52圈中的第49圈\n所有人都要重新列队\n\n2450\n02:25:52.000 --> 02:25:59.020 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n勒克莱尔一定在想\n我还要闯多少关才能赢英国大奖赛\n\n2452\n02:25:59.660 --> 02:26:01.696 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他多次遭遇末段意外变数\n","147":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n2452\n02:25:59.660 --> 02:26:01.696 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他多次遭遇末段意外变数\n\n2453\n02:26:01.780 --> 02:26:07.036 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n2021年还剩3圈，汉密尔顿超越勒克莱尔\n后者没有进站换上正确轮胎\n\n2454\n02:26:07.120 --> 02:26:11.440 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n2022年，塞恩斯超车\n拿下个人首个大奖赛冠军\n\n2455\n02:26:11.720 --> 02:26:18.320 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n如今还剩几圈\n我们排在安全车后面\n\n2457\n02:26:19.280 --> 02:26:22.880 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n安全车情况下的各种可能性又都出现了\n\n2458\n02:26:23.280 --> 02:26:29.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n如果安全车现在进站，还能跑2圈\n但前方仍夹着慢车\n\n2460\n02:26:31.900 --> 02:26:35.540 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我们因赛道边界违规领到5秒罚时\n\n2461\n02:26:36.020 --> 02:26:38.700 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这太荒唐了，兄弟，我不是故意的\n\n2462\n02:26:39.240 --> 02:26:41.120 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n就像车坏了一样\n\n2463\n02:26:42.440 --> 02:26:45.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n收到，我根本没因此赚到时间\n\n2464\n02:26:45.820 --> 02:26:47.380 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n明白，兄弟，明白\n\n2465\n02:26:49.720 --> 02:26:52.756 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他找到别的空间\n其他车会在安全车下收拢\n\n2466\n02:26:52.840 --> 02:26:56.456 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n5秒罚时会让他跌出积分区\n\n2467\n02:26:56.540 --> 02:27:01.716 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他最多只有2圈\n可能仅1圈来挽回局面\n","148":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n2467\n02:26:56.540 --> 02:27:01.716 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他最多只有2圈\n可能仅1圈来挽回局面\n\n2468\n02:27:01.800 --> 02:27:02.820 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n代价太大\n\n2469\n02:27:02.820 --> 02:27:05.860 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n我认为车队必须为安东内利\n\n9909035\n02:27:05.860 --> 02:27:07.896 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n申诉这次荒唐判罚\n\n2470\n02:27:07.980 --> 02:27:13.976 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n最多损失1、2分，不会改变大局\n\n247201\n02:27:14.060 --> 02:27:18.588 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n总想带点成果离开\n来看52圈比赛第50圈的排序\n\n247202\n02:27:18.588 --> 02:27:20.940 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n勒克莱尔继续领跑\n\n2474\n02:27:21.140 --> 02:27:24.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n法拉赫已准备挥动方格旗\n\n2475\n02:27:24.200 --> 02:27:27.516 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n拉塞尔留在旧胎上\n\n2476\n02:27:27.600 --> 02:27:30.876 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n汉密尔顿换上新胎后掉到第3\n\n2477\n02:27:30.960 --> 02:27:34.496 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n诺里斯第4，小红牛车手哈贾尔第5\n\n2478\n02:27:34.580 --> 02:27:36.676 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n小红牛目前两辆车都在积分区\n\n2479\n02:27:36.760 --> 02:27:38.820 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n博托莱托的处罚已经计入排名\n\n2480\n02:27:39.100 --> 02:27:44.980 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n科拉平托升至第9\n加斯利拿到最后1分\n\n2481\n02:27:45.300 --> 02:27:48.700 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n安全车灯仍亮着\n若重启将是一圈定胜负\n\n2482\n02:27:49.080 --> 02:27:58.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n诺里斯与哈贾尔之间仍有一辆威廉姆斯\n车阵中还有待解套慢车\n\n2484\n02:27:59.220 --> 02:28:01.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n按规则无需放行\n","149":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n2484\n02:27:59.220 --> 02:28:01.300 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n按规则无需放行\n\n2485\n02:28:02.280 --> 02:28:05.160 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n通常还是会让领跑集团通过\n\n2486\n02:28:06.240 --> 02:28:07.740 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n对，这通常是既定流程\n\n2487\n02:28:08.960 --> 02:28:17.240 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n2021年阿布扎比后相关流程经历严格审查\n当时还更换了赛事总监，这次还能再换吗？\n\n2489\n02:28:17.960 --> 02:28:19.620 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n鲁伊·马尔克斯拥有最终决定权\n\n2490\n02:28:21.560 --> 02:28:25.720 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若放行1辆，所有落后慢车都必须放行\n这就是关键区别\n\n2491\n02:28:25.820 --> 02:28:33.180 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若能跑1个比赛圈\n诺里斯就能用新软胎进攻拉塞尔\n\n2494\n02:28:33.520 --> 02:28:41.620 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n汉密尔顿在问最后进攻几圈该用哪个模式\n前提是还能跑2圈\n\n2496\n02:28:41.780 --> 02:28:48.500 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n即将进入倒数第2圈\n安全车这圈必须进站才能留1个比赛圈\n\n2498\n02:28:49.100 --> 02:28:51.600 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n落后慢车现在可以超过安全车\n\n2499\n02:28:52.940 --> 02:28:55.520 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n好，看来会重启，他们要把这些车清走\n\n2500\n02:28:55.780 --> 02:28:56.780 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他们开始放行了\n\n2501\n02:28:59.380 --> 02:29:01.756 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n车队与赛事总监已有共识\n","150":"WEBVTT\nX-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000\n\n2501\n02:28:59.380 --> 02:29:01.756 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n车队与赛事总监已有共识\n\n2502\n02:29:01.840 --> 02:29:07.380 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n只要有机会重启比赛，就一定会尝试\n\n2503\n02:29:07.660 --> 02:29:10.540 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n若赛事总监认为无法留下比赛圈\n\n2504\n02:29:10.840 --> 02:29:14.876 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n他有权出示红旗\n\n2505\n02:29:14.960 --> 02:29:17.976 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这是车队持续讨论审查的集体共识\n\n2506\n02:29:18.060 --> 02:29:20.496 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n英国大奖赛进入倒数第2圈\n\n2507\n02:29:20.580 --> 02:29:22.080 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n千万别走开！\n\n2508\n02:29:22.200 --> 02:29:25.840 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle\n这里的比赛总是充满戏剧性\n\n2509\n02:29:25.960 --> 02:29:29.400 a